# 统一换行符为 LF（跨平台确定性）
# - 文本文件：规范化行尾为 LF
# - 已知二进制扩展名：强制 binary，避免误改
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件显式声明，禁止换行转换 / 差异检测
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.parquet binary
*.npy binary
*.npz binary
*.pkl binary
*.whl binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.so binary
*.bin binary